<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 105,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 105,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts Thursday were 105,000 head, compared with the estimate of 100,000, USDA reported.</p>
<p>Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of Barrows and Gilts steady to $0.50 per cwt higher than midsession Thursday.</p>
